From a9fb7cfad8f18efb0c12e42e1fdc417f3dcfd2f7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hongfeng Chen <hongfengchen@xiaomi.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 11:15:42 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] zram: keep the hot statistics per CPU

Backport the five per-CPU counters to the Android GKI 6.12 zram driver.
Pin the CPU once per slot transition and use local64_t so updates also
work from interrupt context and remote reads do not tear on 32-bit.
Include Android prefetch reuse and repopulation in byte/huge accounting.
Sum all possible CPUs for sysfs and reset the shards after draining I/O.

Link: https://lore.kernel.org/all/20261017031542.3504947-1-hongfengchen@xiaomi.com/
